BEER — Biophysical Evaluation Engine for Residues

BEER's AI predictions use the ESM C 600M protein language model, downloaded on first use from
the Hugging Face repository biohub/ESMC-600M. That model is distributed under the MIT licence
(Copyright Chan Zuckerberg Biohub, Inc.; https://github.com/Biohub/esm). BEER does not
redistribute the model; it is fetched by the user's installation.

The BEER prediction heads were trained on ESM C 600M embeddings and are distributed with BEER's
releases under the same GNU General Public License v3 as the source code.

